# EVE rule test 2 — the check's constants are held in fixed ranges
zxapp 1
id eve_rule_2
matrix 1
name Eve Rule 2
provides r truth a b
logic eve r <<
eve t
counts = 1 .. 100

blk {
  count: counts 1 .. 100
  cap: counts 100 .. 100
}
.
# expected: accept (the check's constants are held in fixed ranges)
